# Hangman Game (C)

A terminal-based Hangman game developed in C.

---

## Features

- Random word selection
- File handling
- ASCII interface
- Add new words
- Input validation
- Header file organization

---

## Technologies

- C
- GCC
- Standard C Library

---

## Project Structure
src/
    forca.c
    forca.h

data/
    palavras.txt

images/
    preview.png

---

## How to Run

### Linux

```bash
gcc src/forca.c -o hangman
./hangman

Windows (MinGW)

gcc src/forca.c -o hangman.exe
hangman.exe